+# Lending library
+
+A small service of a lending library. The module `loan` keeps the loans, sends the notices of overdue loans and closes each day of lending.
+
+- Java 17 and Spring Boot 3.3.5, with JUnit 5 and Spring Boot Test.
+- The application lives under `org.example.library`. Each module follows the hexagonal layout: `app/api` holds what the module offers, `app/spi` what it needs, `app/domain` the business rules, `in` the entries, `out` the stores and the senders, and `config` the wiring.
+- The stores keep their data in memory, so the service needs no database. The notices are written to the log.
